		},
		{
			"id":"949d72274bc54599",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Method 1: [[Preparing Salt by reaction of acid with an excess insoluble substance]]\n* Acid + excess metal\n* Acid + excess insoluble base\n* Acid + excess insoluble carbonate",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-880,
			"y":493,
			"width":292,
			"height":307,
